cessible.&nbsp; The Branch though cannot
 stop the landlord from doing the renovations; only advising them that they=
 must ensure you have access to the services until May 1, 2024.&nbsp; &nbsp=
;If your items are damaged because of the landlord=E2=80=99s negligence (ei=
ther due to the dust or security) then you have the
 right to file a claim through our Branch for compensation.&nbsp; A hearing=
 would be scheduled at which point a hearing officer would make a decision =
regarding your claim.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"mso-fareast-language:EN-US"><o:p>&nbs=
p;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"mso-fareast-language:EN-US">The Branc=
h will be investigating the withdrawal of services for the other units but =
on an individual unit basis.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
