</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Good morning,<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">There is currently drilling which is preventing me a=
ccess and also welding that produces a hazardous environment. Although the =
construction workers are using gear and appear to be following healthy work=
 and safety protocol what about the
 effects on my health? The noise is above 120 dc and there are toxic fumes =
being produced although the windows are opened a crack. How can I do my lau=
ndry or use my storage unit when this is underway? Notice in the video the =
inaccessibility.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">The measurements of the storage unit are 90 cm x 60<=
span style=3D"font-family:&quot;UICTFontTextStyleBody&quot;,serif">&nbsp;cm=
 x 60&nbsp;cm. The door is unlocked from 8:30 am until 4:30 pm each day of =
construction.&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Please note that on form 8 the landlord has stated t=
here will be no rent reduction despite stating otherwise in emails to me. I=
 assume you have access to a copy.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Mr. Maclean, this landlord has engaged in deceptive =
practices and the reasons are clear: Although the laundry and storage servi=
ces have been provided to me since my tenancy began in 2012, new tenants ha=
ve not had the services indicated
 in their lease agreements. The service of storage&nbsp;was denied to new t=
enants without following proper protocol because the landlord has had plans=
 to do this two suite creation since 2018 upon purchase of the property. De=
spite having the storage units available
 and identified as correlated to individual suites (see photos in previous =
emails) the landlord has left these services empty and were not provided to=
 tenants at no cost to themselves and with only the goal of making these re=
novations as cheap as possible for
 themselves. Good business practices would be to withdraw the services whic=
h are a
<b>physical reality</b> by following RTB protocol which was not done.&nbsp;=
 The tenants who have either permitted or been deceived into permitting on =
suite renovations in which their storage space was reduced further to make =
room for the laundry services. The fact
 of the matter is that storage space in each of the renovated units has bee=
n decreased and each of the tenants since 2018 have been denied the storage=
 unit services despite being available, accessible, and clearly indicated a=
s correlated to the tenant suites.
 Thorwin Properties has engaged is deception and unethical treatment of the=
ir tenants and all tenants affected should be reimbursed for these self-ser=
ving practices. Let me be clear, there have been a reduction in services pr=
ovided to all tenants and yet rent
 increases have increased each year which have deceptively not reflected th=
e reduction in storage space in each of the renovated tenants suites due to=
 the laundry services being installed and denial of storage unit services d=
espite availability and accessibility.<o:p></o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">This company has exploited RTB protocol on technical=
ity and this cannot be allowed.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>
